{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999310/extras/4965243f982eb44311bd42c2ded5e4b4.avif?t=1759595506\" width=335 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect different kinds of Mushrooms all based on real-life Mushrooms you may find in the wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999310/extras/989dfb3619d4107a713cbedfd9c166b2.webp?t=1759595506\" width=335 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999310/extras/65a7c1fe6ff8f7c296d100b98fdeb65c.avif?t=1759595506\" width=68 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are the newest Mushroom Wizard Initiate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hand in your Mushrooms to the Mushroom Wizard to earn XP and level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999310/extras/70e6a554c160b60a0cd31e56b4194707.avif?t=1759595506\" width=335 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can hire little creatures of the forest to harvest your Mushrooms for you, so you don't have to do anything except sit back, relax, and watch that number go up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999310/extras/6b941de9545d2bd80e1b5ee902307779.avif?t=1759595506\" width=500 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you level up, spend your skill points on lots of different skills and spells to customize your playthrough, find crazy synergies and make that number go up even faster!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999310?t=1759595506","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999310?t=1759595506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999310/42c50c60fce4c735fc4f689b7ed5f616b7cf9ec1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759595506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999310/42c50c60fce4c735fc4f689b7ed5f616b7cf9ec1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759595506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999310/extras/4965243f982eb44311bd42c2ded5e4b4.avif?t=1759595506\" width=335 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect different kinds of Mushrooms all based on real-life Mushrooms you may find in the wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999310/extras/989dfb3619d4107a713cbedfd9c166b2.webp?t=1759595506\" width=335 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999310/extras/65a7c1fe6ff8f7c296